id: 1
hanzi: 农历
pinyin: nóng lì
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Noun

meanings_summary:
  en: traditional Chinese lunisolar calendar; lunar calendar; agricultural calendar
  es: calendario tradicional chino; calendario agrícola; calendario lunisolar

senses[1]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Noun | Standard | the traditional Chinese lunisolar calendar based on astronomical cycles, dividing the year into 24 solar terms to guide farming and traditional festivities | calendario tradicional chino lunisolar basado en ciclos astronómicos y 24 periodos solares para guiar la agricultura y las fiestas | 农历新年 (Lunar New Year)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 每逢农历除夕，全家人无论走得多远，都会赶回家吃一顿热气腾腾的年夜饭。 | Měi féng Nónglì Chúxī, quánjiā rén wúlùn zǒu de duō yuǎn, dōu huì gǎnhuí jiā chī yí dùn rèqì téngténg de niányèfàn. | Every Lunar New Year's Eve, no matter how far family members have traveled, they rush home to share a steaming reunion dinner. | Cada víspera del Año Nuevo lunar, por lejos que hayan viajado, los miembros de la familia se apresuran a regresar al hogar para compartir una humeante cena de fin de año.
  #2 | 农历不仅是一套历法体系，更深刻融入了中国古代农耕文明的物候节律与礼俗制度。 | Nónglì bùjǐn shì yí tào lìfǎ tǐxì, gèng shēnkè róngrù le Zhōngguó gǔdài nónggēng wénmíng de wùhòu jiélǜ yǔ lǐsú zhìdù. | The lunisolar calendar is not merely a chronological system, but is profoundly integrated into the phenological rhythms and ritual institutions of ancient Chinese agrarian civilization. | El calendario tradicional no es solo un sistema cronológico, sino que está profundamente arraigado en los ritmos fenológicos y las instituciones rituales de la civilización agraria china.

collocations[6]{hanzi,en}:
  农历新年 | Lunar New Year; Spring Festival
  农历除夕 | Lunar New Year's Eve
  农历八月十五 | the fifteenth of the eighth lunar month (Mid-Autumn Festival)
  农历初一 | the first day of the lunar month
  农历节气 | solar terms of the traditional agricultural calendar
  查农历 | consult the lunar calendar

idioms[4]{hanzi,pinyin,meaning_en}:
  不误农时 | bù wù nóng shí | do not miss the farming season
  历历在目 | lì lì zài mù | remain fresh in one's memory; leap clearly before the eyes
  辛勤耕耘 | xīn qín gēng yún | cultivate diligently; work with industrious effort
  风调雨顺 | fēng tiáo yǔ shùn | favorable weather for agriculture; propitious climate

character_decomposition[2]{character,pinyin,meaning_en,meaning_es,radical,radical_meaning_en,meaning_component,sound_component,stroke_count,composition_type,etymology_and_mnemonic,visual_mnemonic_story_en,visual_mnemonic_story_es,tone_mnemonic_anchor,cangjie,traditional}:
  农 | nóng | agriculture; farming; peasant | agricultura; campesino; cultivar | 冖 | cover / crown | 辰 (celestial sign / agrarian timing) | 辰 (chén) | 6 | 单一结构 | Simplified from traditional 農 (辰 celestial time + 曲 field harvest). Depicts agricultural labor attuned to heavenly seasonal cycles. | A peasant sheltered beneath a wide woven hat (冖) tending fertile shoots in the field with patient devotion. | Un campesino protegido por un sombrero ancho (冖) labrando con devoción los brotes fértiles de la tierra. | 35 | BNV | 農
  历 | lì | calendar; pass through; undergo | calendario; transcurrir; experimentar | 厂 | cliff / shelter | 厂 (cliff shelter / passage of time) | 力 (lì, power / phonetic) | 4 | 半包围结构 | Simplified from traditional 曆 (calendar) and 歷 (experience). Phono-semantic compound where 力 provides sound beneath sheltering cliff 厂. | Recording cycles of seasons beneath a rocky cliff (厂) with steady, enduring human effort (力). | Grabar los ciclos estacionales bajo un acantilado (厂) con la fuerza y empeño (力) de las manos humanas. | 51 | MKS | 曆

mnemonics_and_roots:
  composite_memory_hook_en: Peasant farming (农) follows the passage of cosmic time beneath heaven (历) recorded in the lunar calendar (农历).
  composite_memory_hook_es: El cultivo campesino (农) sigue el transcurso de los ciclos del cielo (历) registrado en el calendario lunar (农历).
  cultural_and_cognitive_roots: Combining agrarian rhythm (农) with historical and astronomical passage (历), 农历 is deeply anchored to the twenty-four solar terms (二十四节气) which guided ancestral Chinese agricultural sowing, harvesting, and festive reunions for millennia.
  tone_sandhi_and_pitch_modulation: Rising 2nd tone 'nóng' (35) followed by sharp falling 4th tone 'lì' (51). Move cleanly from the rising melodic glide into the decisive downward drop.

traps_and_cognates:
  look_alikes[5]{character,pinyin,meaning_en,distinction_note}:
    厉 | lì | severe; stern | Has 厂 with 万 inside instead of 力
    励 | lì | encourage; urge | Has 厉 on the left and 力 on the right
    压 | yā | press; suppress | Has 厂 with 土 and a dot inside instead of 力
    充 | chōng | fill; charge | Has 亠 and 厶 and 儿 instead of 农's curved strokes
    迈 | mài | step; stride | Has walking radical 辶 around 万
  etymological_cognates[5]{character,pinyin,gloss_en}:
